examples DelveTalk 1

case visitors open the paper door
law maker visitor
observe main
  title: The paper door
  prose: A paper door with a brass knocker. Whisper please.
  offer knock -> knock: Whisper to the door
expect view

as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: please
expect result: The paper door swings open onto a tiny lantern-lit room.

as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: please
expect refusal: stale read root

as visitor
send knock
  word: wrong
expect refusal: source refused: precondition failed

as outsider
send knock
  word: please
  principal: maker
expect refusal: typed data record fields differ from declared type

as outsider
send knock
  word: please
expect refusal: unauthorized
